              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "விளையாட்டு — viḷaiyāṭṭu — \"a game, a sport\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "விளையாட்டு (viḷaiyāṭṭu) is native Dravidian. DEDR 5438 lists Malayalam viḷay-āṭṭu, \"play, sport\". It is the noun of viḷaiyāṭu, \"to play\". DEDR compares, with a query, Sanskrit vilāsa, \"play\"."
            }
          ]
        },
